From f686569bee92b5a660885e2bfc42eeb7bec83b80 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hades <15710513+hadesdevls@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 05:33:42 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] estuary: strings of the skin above 31999 are read as
 $ADDON[skin.estuary n]; the buttons of the player information have their real
 size

Two faults that the real Kodi showed and the drawing from the files did not.

Kodi reads $LOCALIZE[n] as a string of the skin only for 31000 to 31999
(ADDON::IsSkinStringId); any other id is a string of Kodi itself, and an id
of Estuary's from 32000 up came out blank. That was so for the strings that
Hades added before (32002 to 32428 in Variables.xml and the page of the
player information, 32501 "Restart LibreELEC Hades" in the power menu) and
for the 98 of the new panel. They are now read as $ADDON[skin.estuary n],
as the pages of Hades for other skins already read them (the generator
makes that of every string of Estuary's). Only ids that are Estuary's and
are in no string file of Kodi were changed: the other uses of $LOCALIZE
above 31999 in Estuary are Kodi's own strings and stay. The check of the
skin files now fails on a $LOCALIZE of an id of Estuary outside the range,
and a copy with one is in its set of broken copies.

button-fo.png is 80x80 with a transparent margin of 20, so a button of 56
high draws a pill of 16 (the tabs and the button of the output of the video
came out as a flat bar with the text cut). Those buttons are now the size
of the pill plus 40 in each direction, and the tab strip and the buttons
are moved by 20 to keep their place.
